<title>PORTUGAL: SOCCER-PORTUGAL BEAT UKRAINE 1-0.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PORTUGAL BEAT UKRAINE 1-0.</headline>
<dateline>OPORTO, Portugal 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal beat Ukraine 1-0</p>
<p>(halftime 0-0) in a World Cup European group nine qualifying</p>
<p>match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Fernando Couto 58</p>
<p>Attendance: 30,000</p>
<p>Group nine standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn,</p>
<p>lost. goals for, goals against, points)</p>
<p>    Portugal	     4   2   1   1   5   2   7</p>
<p>    Ukraine		3   2   0   1   3   2   6</p>
<p>    Germany		2   1   1   0   6   2   4</p>
<p>    Armenia		4   0   3   1   3   7   3</p>
<p>    Northern Ireland   3   0   2   1   2   3   2</p>
<p>    Albania		2   0   1   1   1   4   1</p>
<p>Next matches: Dec 14 Northern Ireland v Albania, Portugal v</p>
<p>Germany</p>
</text>
